## Как использовать

<%- if example_endpoint -%>
```ruby
credentials = { 'api_key' => ENV.fetch('<%= api_key_env %>')<%= webhook ? ", 'callback_secret' => ENV.fetch('#{callback_secret_env}')" : '' %> }
service     = Provider::<%= info.provider_class_name %>.new(client: Faraday.new, credentials: credentials)

# 1. Prechecks
result = service.check_conditions(operation, 'create')
return result if result.failed?

# 2. Create payout
result = service.create_request(operation)
raise "Create failed: #{result.message_key}" if result.failed?

# 3. Poll status (or wait for webhook)
status = service.fetch_status(operation)   # => 'in_progress' | 'approved' | 'rejected'

<%- if webhook -%>
# 4. Handle webhook (payload must include _signature + _raw_body — see above)
service.process_callback(webhook_payload)
<%- end -%>
```
<%- end -%>
